data: {"delta":{"partial_json":"{\"file_path\": \"/home/<USER:1>/.local/share/cs-campaign/output/d002-report.md\", \"content\": \"# Dispatch d002 report — \\\"greet, tested\\\"\\n\\n## Implemented\\n\\n- `src/greet.py` — `greet(name)` returns `\\\"Hello, {}!\\\".format(name)`.\\n- `tests/test_greet.py` — `unittest.TestCase` with two tests:\\n  - `test_normal_name`: `greet(\\\"World\\\") == \\\"Hello, World!\\\"`\\n  - `test_empty_string`: `greet(\\\"\\\") == \\\"Hello, !\\\"`\\n\\n## Test run\\n\\nCommand: `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests` (run from repo root `~/subject`)\\n\\n```\\n..\\n----------------------------------------------------------------------\\nRan 2 tests in 0.000s\\n\\nOK\\nEXIT_CODE=0\\n```\\n\\n## Commit\\n\\nCommitted on branch `cs-sandbox/<DEV:1>.<GROUP:1>`:\\n\\n```\\n5ed6317 Add greet function with unit tests\\n```\\n\\nBranch base was `c2c400d` (matches `member.json`'s recorded base). Only\\n`src/greet.py` and `tests/test_greet.py` were added; no other files were\\ntouched (untracked `__pycache__` directories were left untracked, not\\ncommitted).\\n\\n## Status\\n\\nAll requirements met. No blockers.\\n\"}","type":"input_json_delta"},"index":1,"type":"content_block_delta"}

